  "body": "If easy-care living in a sought-after coastal location is high on your wish list, this one deserves your attention!\r\n\r\nTucked away in a quiet cul-de-sac, this well-presented single-level brick and tile home offers the perfect combination of comfort, convenience and low-maintenance living.\r\n\r\nInside, you'll find three generous bedrooms, and two bathrooms, including a master ensuite, and a separate family bathroom. The open-plan kitchen and living with views across Stanmore Bay creates a welcoming hub for everyday living, flowing out to a covered patio where you can relax and entertain.\r\nThe fully fenced gardens are pretty and practical, providing a safe space for children and pets to play. Add a single internal-access garage and off-street parking, and you have all the essentials covered.\r\nWhether you're stepping onto the property ladder, looking for a smart investment, or ready to downsize without compromising on lifestyle, this is an opportunity worth exploring.\r\n\r\nSituated within walking distance of Arkles Bay Beach, Coast Plaza shops and amenities, and Hoyts movie theatre. Zoned for Whangaparaoa Primary and Whangaparaoa College, and just a short drive or bus ride to Wentworth Schools, all bases are covered.\r\n\r\nEasy living, a great location and a lifestyle to love. Don't miss this opportunity to secure your place in popular Stanmore Bay.\r\n\r\nCall us today to arrange your viewing!",
